      "content": "That's a good start for the outline. To make the paper more rigorous, I want to dig deeper into the \"social decay\" and \"cultural dilution\" part. Can you expand on the specific pseudo-scientific or sociological theories they used back then to support that? Like, what were the actual \"logical\" foundations they used to argue that integration would lead to a breakdown of the social order?",
